1 NOTE {geni:about_me}   BUCK VERY ATHLETIC, LOVED SPORTS. LOVED HIS HARLEY.  LOVED AND WAS DEVOTED TO HIS FAMILY.
2 CONT   HE WAS AN ENGINEER AND WHIZ AT MATH. LOVED TO CAMP, FISH, HUNT, GARDEN. FAVORITE PLACE WAS COTTAGE IN WISCONSIN. TRIED TO GROW A MUSTACHE IN THE 70'S AND IT CAME OUT BRIGHT RED!  SERVED IN WWII AS A TECH SEARGENT IN THE SIGNAL C
2 CONC ORPS.  STAYED IN THE RESERVES UNTIL 1949 AND FINISHED HIS EDUCATION.
2 CONT    BUCK WAS NEVER ON TIME FOR ANYTHING. VERY LAID BACK AND A DRY SENSE OF HUMOR. HE WAS A WINE MAKER AND TOOK PRIDE IN HIS PINK CATABWA. ALSO MADE BEER.   . AFTER 5 YEARS OF TECHNICAL SCHOOL IN KANSAS CITY, CHICAGO AND ASHLAND WIS
2 CONC CONSIN, HE WORKED AT WSPD/WTVG - CHANNEL 13 IN TOLEDO AS ONE OF THE FIRST TELEVISION ENGINEERS/CAMERAMAN/AUDIO MAN.  RETIRED IN 1984.  MAINTAINED HIS SHORT WAVE RADIO LISCENCE UNTIL HIS DEATH.  THE RADIO STILL WORKS! . DROVE A RAM
2 CONC BLER UNTIL THEY WENT OUT OF BUSINESS. FIERCELY LOYAL TO THE DETROIT TIGERS AND THE LIONS - NO MATTER HOW BAD THEY PLAYED. LOVED TO GO TO MONAC SCHOOL AND SHAG FLIES WITH HIS KIDS - WE DID THE CHASING - AND COULD HE HIT! 
2 CONT    HAD A LOT OF PERSONAL COURAGE AND WOULD STAND UP FOR HIS BELIEFS AGAINST ANYONE - FOR HIS SIZE HE WAS INTIMIDATING. HE BELIEVED THE RULES WERE FOR EVERYONE.  QUIT SMOKING ON THE DAY KENNEDY WAS SHOT - TO REMEMBER THE DAY . LOVE
2 CONC D TO GRILL AND USED THE KANSAS CITY BBQ METHOD ON EVERYTHING - SLOW INDIRECT COOKING W/ LOTS OF WOOD CHIPS. DELICIOUS! BEST STEAKS  IVE EVER HAD. LUCKILY, DOUG ALSO KNOWS THIS TECHNIQUE! 
2 CONT   BUCK AND WINNIE ALWAYS HAD AN ICE RINK IN THE BACK YARD EVERY WINTER TO PLAY HOCKEY. LOVED TO PLAY HOCKEY AND HAD A PAIR OF SKATES FOR EVERYONE THAT SHOWED UP. ! ALSO LOVED TO HUNT JACK RABBITS ON SKIS WITH A 22. WE ALL MISS HIM
2 CONC , AND LOST HIM TOO SOON.
