2 CONT * Death:	Jan 21 1663 - Mesinge Sogn, Bjerge Herred, Odense Amt
2 CONT * Parents:	Jens Hansen Tausen, Kirsten Bertelsdatter Tausen (born Struch)
2 CONT * Brother:	Christian Tausen
2 CONT * Wife:	Else Jonsdatter Becker/hovi/tausen (born Jonsdatter Holmsted)
2 CONT * Children:	Jonas Tauson, Laurits Tausen
