1 NAME Elisabet Marie Hansdatter /Svaning/
2 GIVN Elisabet Marie Hansdatter
2 _MARNM Svaning
2 NICK Friis
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1575
2 ADDR
