1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Our beloved mother, grandmother, sister and aunt, Alda Delight Gundersen Lovell, age 76, died Oct 25, 2010 peacefully at her home in Fredericksburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born Sept 4, 1934 in Staten Island Hospital, New York City; the daughter of Henry and Delight Gundersen, both deceased and buried in Crown View Cemetery, Sheridan IN.  She was married Apr 25, 1953 to Earl F. Lovell, a reti
2 CONC red Marine Colonel, who preceded her in death in 1999 and is buried at Quantico National Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alda is survived by her four children, Deborah D. Lovell, Sandra L. Lovell, Stephen J. Lovell of Virginia and Robin L. Dial of Minnesota; Four grandchildren, Kyle Doyle, Kelly Doyle, Siglind Dial and Linnea Dial; a sister, Betty L
2 CONC ee Cooper of Indiana; a nephew, Chris D. Glover; and many cousins and Aunts and an Uncle who reside in Indiana.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was baptized and Confirmed as a Lutheran, then joined St. Mary's Episcopal Church in Arlington, VA in 1989.  Upon moving to Fredericksburg in 2008, she attended Christ Episcopal Church in Spotsylvania CH.  Alda was very active
2 CONC  in the Episcopal Church, completing 4 years of Education for Ministry, a Lay Reader and Chalice Bearer and Sunday School teacher for 20 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alda graduated from George Mason University in 1984 with a BSN and worked in many areas of Nursing, ending her career as an Occupational Nurse, managing a Health Clinic at the Department of Education in DC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alda was a member of the National Honor Society of Secondary Schools, DAR and St. Mary's Episcopal Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Viewing for family and friends will be at Kercheval's Funeral Home in Sheridan, IN, Friday, Oct 29 and Burial will be held on Sat, Oct 30 in Crown View Cemetery, Sheridan, IN.  A memorial service will be held at a later time at St
2 CONC . Mary's Episcopal Church in Arlington VA.  Memorial gifts may be sent to St Mary's Episcopal Church, Arlington VA and to Christ Episcopal Church, Spotsylvania VA.
