1 NOTE {geni:about_me} We know very little about Elizabeth, supposedly she moved with her husband to Maine with her 9 year old son, Alfred.  In reality she remarried about a year after her husband, Edward's death, to James Wood.  She had
2 CONC  a slew more children and never left Prince Edward Island,  She is buried with her 2nd Husband in W. Devon, PEI.   
2 CONT --------------------
