1 OCCU operator at JC Penney's Catalog center,  Musician and singer well known locally in Ohio and Wisconsin
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} KNOWN AS WINNIE.  NAME ON BIRTH CERTIFICATE WAS BERNICE WINIFRED AND SHE HATED BERNICE - SO SHE SWITCHED THEM AROUND.
2 CONT   GREW UP ON THE MALUM FARM IN CAMERON AND LOVED LIVING ON A FARM. LOVED MUSIC AND ANIMALS. FAVORITE PLACE WAS AT HER COTTAGE IN WISCONSIN WITH BUCK, AND GRAND MARNIER ON THE SHORE OF LAKE SUPERIOR.
2 CONT   HAD A BEAUTIFUL SINGING VOICE AND MAJORED IN IT AT UNIVERSITY OF WISCONSIN, MADISON. WAS A GREAT COOK AND LOVED LARGE FAMILY DINNERS.  DESIGNED THE LANDSCAPING IN HER BACKYARD ON NAOMI W/ HER FAVORITE RHODEDENDRONS AND AZELIAS O
2 CONC N THE SANDSTONE WALL AND 3 CORNER PIECE. 
2 CONT  LOVED DOGS SO MUCH SHE NEVER WANTED ANOTHER THEN FELL IN LOVE WITH THE NEXT ONE. FAVORITE BOOK BESIDES THE BIBLE WAS "ALL CREATURES GREAT AND SMALL".    VERY SENSITIVE AND WROTE POETRY AND PROSE. SANG IN THE CHURCH CHOIR, THE MOT
2 CONC HERSINGERS, THE STACY SINGERS. STAGED FUNDRAISERS FOR THE PTA, SHOWCASING NEIGHBORHOOD TALENT!   SANG FREQUENT DUETS W/ HER FRIEND, RAY WHITAKER. WHO SANG AT HER FUNERAL.
2 CONT  TAUGHT HERSELF TO PLAY THE PIANO - AND PLAYED BY EAR COMPLICATED JAZZ/BLUES/BIG BAND SONGS.  VERY RELIGIOUS AND TREASURED HER RELATIONSHIP W/ GOD.
2 CONT   SHE WAS THE ONLY PERSON THAT COULD PERSUADE DAD TO CHANGE HIS MIND ABOUT SOMETHING. 
2 CONT  ALSO LOVED TO CAMP, EVEN IF IT WASN'T A VACATION "FOR HER"  LOVED TO GO OUT IN THE SPEEDBOAT AS LONG AS SHE COULD SEE THE SHORELINE.  LAKE ERIE WASN'T HER THING.     ALWAYS HELPED PEOPLE IN NEED AND GAVE THEM A SECOND AND THIRD C
2 CONC HANCE, AND ALWAYS KNEW WHAT TO SAY AND WHEN TO SAY IT - WHEN NO ONE ELSE WOULD.  LIKED TO HAVE HER OWN WAY AND WENT OUT OF HER WAY TO GET IT. 
2 CONT  LOVED HER GRANDCHILDREN AND THEY LOVED HER.  WAS A WHIZ AT THE STOCK MARKET AND MADE LOTS OF MONEY W/ HER BROKER IN THE 90'S.  LOVED GENEALOGY AND TRIED TO FIRM UP DADS FAMILY TREE USING LIMITED RESOURCES AVAILABLE TO HER.  SHE W
2 CONC OULD HAVE LOVED THE INTERNET!  
2 CONT   As my mom, she is the start of my maternal line of mtDNA with haplotype T2b7a.
